<!-- STAB-0549 fixture: a Mesh object referencing an embedded glTF via
     meshSource="embed:tree" (parsed/serialized/round-tripped correctly
     by mc3/Mc3XmlParser+Writer, per mc3/test/roundtrip_test.cpp's
     testEmbedGltf), used to confirm GltfExporter's current, documented
     behavior for this case: it treats "embed:tree" as a literal OBJ
     file path (GltfExporter.cpp:417-424), which fails to open, so
     export continues with a warning and an empty (meshless) node
     rather than crashing â€” a known, unfixed limitation (NEXT.md
     "What does NOT work yet"), not something this fixture expects to
     pass cleanly. -->
